nChip","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"OUDSSuggestionChip","abstract":[{"text":"Suggestion chip is a UI element that allows to present recommended or predictive options based on user’s input or context,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and is commonly used to capture filtering decisions.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Suggestion chip is typically non-selected by default and can be tapped or clicked to apply the suggestion, streamlining input and enhancing usability.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Chips can show multiple interactive elements together in the same area, such as a list of selectable movie times, or a serie of email contacts.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Best suited for category-based filters that do not require additional visual elements.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSSuggestionChip","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSSuggestionChip/sliderThumbVisibility(_:)":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSSuggestionChip\/sliderThumbVisibility(_:)","title":"sliderThumbVisibility(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudssuggestionchip\/sliderthumbvisibility(_:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"sliderThumbVisibility"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI10VisibilityO","text":"Visibility"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View"}]}}}